  "definition": "Requirements for Applicants for a Foster Family Care License",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-06-16",
  "historyNote": "#7184, INTERIM, eff 12-28-99, EXPIRED: 4-26-00 New. #7321, eff 7-22-00; ss by #8663, eff 6-16-06; ss by #10788, eff 2-21-15 (from He-C 6446.03); ss by #13056, eff 6-16-20",
